{"id":"4e2db324148413bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Branch Through Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree — ZFC Tree10 Branch Through Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree — ZFC Tree10 Branch Through Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree — ZFC Tree10 Branch Through Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,T,s,t,u\\in V\">\\(B,T,s,t,u\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S(B,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land B\\subseteq T\\land B\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall s,t\\in B\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;((\\exists t\\in B\\;u\\subseteq t)\\to u\\in B)\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;((\\forall t\\in B\\;(u\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq u))\\to u\\in B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S(B,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land B\\subseteq T\\land B\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall s,t\\in B\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;((\\exists t\\in B\\;u\\subseteq t)\\to u\\in B)\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;((\\forall t\\in B\\;(u\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq u))\\to u\\in B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is a nonempty downward-closed chain maximal among nodes comparable with every member, hence a branch through the sequence tree <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S$ (tree-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"B,T,s,t,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S(B,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land B\\subseteq T\\land B\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall s,t\\in B\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;((\\exists t\\in B\\;u\\subseteq t)\\to u\\in B)\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;((\\forall t\\in B\\;(u\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq u))\\to u\\in B)","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1257,"backlinks":[{"id":"0f49f8a86fc4b13b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md]])"},{"id":"a6113a3bfb6f9c65","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S$ (branch predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md]])"},{"id":"2c583d5683590dfe","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{